        <detaileddescription>
<para>Run Refinement Loop.</para>
<para>Algorithm:<orderedlist>
<listitem><para>Call <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_self_r_a_g_controller_1a882038339e24509aafe32c5a0ed143d4" kindref="member">shouldRetrieve()</ref></computeroutput>. If false, return early with empty result.</para>
