</listitem><listitem><para>Critic all retrieved documents.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>If <computeroutput>target_relevant_docs</computeroutput> Relevant passages found → stop.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Otherwise increment round counter and re-retrieve (up to max_rounds).</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
