</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Confidence override passed to <computeroutput><ref refid="classthemis_1_1rag_1_1_self_r_a_g_controller_1a882038339e24509aafe32c5a0ed143d4" kindref="member">shouldRetrieve()</ref></computeroutput>. </para>
